Subject: [PATCH 5.0 068/122] net: hns: fix KASAN: use-after-free in hns_nic_net_xmit_hw()
Date:   Mon,  6 May 2019 16:32:06 +0200
Message-Id: <20190506143101.081622139@linuxfoundation.org>
